    {
      "source": "Base class for <code>MessageCondition's</code> that pre-declares abstract methods\n<a href=\"#getContent()\"><code>getContent()</code></a> and <a href=\"#getToStringInfix()\"><code>getToStringInfix()</code></a> in order to provide\nimplementations of <a href=\"#equals(java.lang.Object)\"><code>equals(Object)</code></a>, <a href=\"#hashCode()\"><code>hashCode()</code></a>, and\n<a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "`MessageCondition` 的基类，预先声明了抽象方法 <a href=\"#getContent()\"><code>getContent()</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#getToStringInfix()\"><code>getToStringInfix()</code></a>，以便提供 <a href=\"#equals(java.lang.Object)\"><code>equals(Object)</code></a>、<a href=\"#hashCode()\"><code>hashCode()</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#toString()\"><code>toString()</code></a> 的实现。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the collection of objects the message condition is composed of\n(for example, destination patterns), never <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "返回消息条件所组成的对象集合（例如，目标模式），绝不返回 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The notation to use when printing discrete items of content.\nFor example \" || \" for URL patterns or \" &amp;&amp; \" for param expressions.",
      "translation": "用于打印离散内容项的符号。例如，URL 模式使用\" || \"或参数表达式使用\" && \"。",
      "count": 2
    },
